<title>PHILIPPINES: Kuok to fold up food business.</title>
<headline>Kuok to fold up food business.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuok Philippine Properties Inc said on Monday its board has approved the firm's withdrawal from the food business.</p>
<p>&quot;The board approved the cessation of the business operations of KPPI Food Corporation, the wholly owned food subsidiary of the corporation, effective July 31,&quot; corporate secretary Cynthia Laureta said in a statement.  </p>
<p>Kuok said the closure of its food subsidiary was prompted by its desire to concentrate its resources on its various property development projects.</p>
<p>Shares of the company were unchanged at 1.36 pesos by midtrade at the Philippine Stock Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8936, Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
